  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This kit is ideal for experienced makers"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "1. It consists of commonly used hardware parts and electronic components designed to help creators unleash their creativity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "2. These components allow for the creation of more interesting models, not limited to specific ones."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "3. Each item in this kit can also be purchased separately. After creators finish their creations, creators can upload their BOM (Bill of Materials) for customers to purchase with one click."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "4. This kit saves creators time and accelerates the creation process. Compared to purchasing components individually, it also provides a more cost-effective solution."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p><strong>This kit is ideal for experienced makers</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1. It consists of commonly used hardware parts and electronic components designed to help creators unleash their creativity.</li>\n<li>2. These components allow for the creation of more interesting models, not limited to specific ones.</li>\n<li>3. Each item in this kit can also be purchased separately. After creators finish their creations, creators can upload their BOM (Bill of Materials) for customers to purchase with one click.</li>\n<li>4. This kit saves creators time and accelerates the creation process. Compared to purchasing components individually, it also provides a more cost-effective solution.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Socket Head Cap Machine Screws (SHCS)\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/8bf6f124421c46e5a800775214e85e5a/444_15e3fc72-549f-4e40-a5b6-1a93bafdff6a.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Socket Head Cap Machine Screws (SHCS)\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/8bf6f124421c46e5a800775214e85e5a/444_15e3fc72-549f-4e40-a5b6-1a93bafdff6a.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9